### ============================================================
### PROMETHEUS PROMQL QUERIES - REST HTTP TEST FILE
### Target: http://localhost:9090
### Usage: Install "REST Client" extension in VSCode
###        Click "Send Request" on any ### block
### ============================================================

@prometheus = http://localhost:9090
@range = 5m
@step = 15s


# ==============================================================
# SECTION 1: KAFKA METRICS
# ==============================================================

### [KAFKA] Health Check - Is Prometheus scraping Kafka?
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=up{job="kafka-exporter"}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [KAFKA 1/5] CONSUMER LAG
### Đo: Số message chưa được consumer xử lý
### Đơn vị: messages (số nguyên)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Tổng consumer lag của tất cả consumer groups
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)%20by%20(consumergroup)

### Lag từng topic + partition của 1 consumer group (thay tên group)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=kafka_consumergroup_lag{consumergroup="my-consumer-group"}

### Top 5 consumer group có lag cao nhất
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=topk(5%2C%20sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)%20by%20(consumergroup))

### Lag theo từng topic (tổng hợp qua partitions)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)%20by%20(consumergroup%2C%20topic)

### Lag over time (range query - dùng cho graph)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)%20by%20(consumergroup)&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}

### Alert threshold: Lag > 1000 messages (boolean)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)%20by%20(consumergroup)%20>%201000


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [KAFKA 2/5] CPU USAGE
### Đo: CPU load của Kafka broker JVM process
### Đơn vị: 0.0 - 1.0 (tỷ lệ, nhân 100 = %)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### CPU của Kafka JVM process (qua JMX)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=jvm_process_cpu_load{service="kafka"}

### CPU dạng % (nhân 100)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=jvm_process_cpu_load{service="kafka"}%20*%20100

### CPU của container Kafka (qua cAdvisor) - chính xác hơn
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])

### CPU % so với limit của container
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])%20/%20container_spec_cpu_quota{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}%20*%20container_spec_cpu_period{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"})%20*%20100

### CPU over time (range)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])%20*%20100&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [KAFKA 3/5] RAM (MEMORY)
### Đo: Bộ nhớ heap JVM và RSS của container
### Đơn vị: bytes
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Heap memory đang dùng (JVM)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=jvm_memory_heap_used_bytes{service="kafka"}

### Heap memory tối đa được cấp phát
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=jvm_memory_heap_max_bytes{service="kafka"}

### % Heap đang sử dụng
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(jvm_memory_heap_used_bytes{service="kafka"}%20/%20jvm_memory_heap_max_bytes{service="kafka"})%20*%20100

### RSS Memory của container Kafka (qua cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=container_memory_rss{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}

### Working set memory (thực tế đang dùng, không tính cache)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=container_memory_working_set_bytes{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}

### RAM qua cAdvisor - range
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=container_memory_working_set_bytes{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [KAFKA 4/5] NETWORK IN (Bytes received by broker)
### Đo: Dữ liệu producer gửi vào Kafka broker
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Bytes IN (network ingress) - tất cả topics
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesInPerSec_total[{{range}}])

### Bytes IN theo từng topic
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesInPerSec_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(topic)

### Bytes IN qua cAdvisor (network interface container)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])

### Tổng bytes IN (MB/s)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesInPerSec_total[{{range}}])%20/%201024%20/%201024

### Network IN range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [KAFKA 5/5] NETWORK OUT (Bytes sent by broker to consumers)
### Đo: Dữ liệu consumer đọc ra từ Kafka broker
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Bytes OUT (network egress) - tất cả topics
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesOutPerSec_total[{{range}}])

### Bytes OUT theo từng topic
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesOutPerSec_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(topic)

### Bytes OUT qua cAdvisor
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="kafka"}[{{range}}])

### Tỉ lệ IN/OUT ratio
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesInPerSec_total[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_BytesOutPerSec_total[{{range}}])



# ==============================================================
# SECTION 2: MONGODB METRICS
# ==============================================================

### [MONGODB] Health Check
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=up{job="mongodb"}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 1/6] OPS/SEC (Operations per second)
### Đo: Số lượng thao tác DB thực hiện mỗi giây
### Đơn vị: operations/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Tổng ops/sec (tất cả loại: insert, query, update, delete, command)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(type)

### Chỉ query ops/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="query"}[{{range}}])

### Insert ops/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="insert"}[{{range}}])

### Update ops/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="update"}[{{range}}])

### Delete ops/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="delete"}[{{range}}])

### Command ops/sec (aggregate, find, etc.)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="command"}[{{range}}])

### Ops/sec range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=sum(rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(type)&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 2/6] QUERY LATENCY
### Đo: Thời gian thực thi trung bình của các loại operations
### Đơn vị: microseconds (µs) hoặc milliseconds (ms)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Latency trung bình của reads (µs)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_latency_total{type="reads"}[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_ops_total{type="reads"}[{{range}}])

### Latency trung bình của writes (µs)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_latency_total{type="writes"}[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_ops_total{type="writes"}[{{range}}])

### Latency trung bình của commands (µs)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_latency_total{type="commands"}[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_ops_total{type="commands"}[{{range}}])

### Latency toàn bộ ops (ms) - dễ đọc hơn
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_latency_total[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_ops_total[{{range}}]))%20/%201000

### Latency range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=(rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_latency_total{type="reads"}[{{range}}])%20/%20rate(mongodb_mongod_op_latencies_ops_total{type="reads"}[{{range}}]))%20/%201000&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 3/6] RAM (MEMORY)
### Đo: Bộ nhớ MongoDB đang sử dụng (resident, virtual, wired tiger cache)
### Đơn vị: bytes
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Resident memory (RAM vật lý đang chiếm)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_ss_mem_resident%20*%201024%20*%201024

### Virtual memory (tổng virtual address space)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_ss_mem_virtual%20*%201024%20*%201024

### WiredTiger cache hiện tại (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_mongod_wiredtiger_cache_bytes{type="currently_in_cache"}

### WiredTiger cache max (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_mongod_wiredtiger_cache_bytes{type="maximum_bytes_configured"}

### % cache đang dùng
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(mongodb_mongod_wiredtiger_cache_bytes{type="currently_in_cache"}%20/%20mongodb_mongod_wiredtiger_cache_bytes{type="maximum_bytes_configured"})%20*%20100

### Container RAM (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=container_memory_working_set_bytes{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 4/6] CPU
### Đo: CPU time dùng bởi MongoDB process
### Đơn vị: cores hoặc % (0.0 - 1.0)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### CPU của MongoDB container (cAdvisor) - đơn vị: cores
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}[{{range}}])

### CPU % của MongoDB container
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}[{{range}}])%20*%20100

### CPU range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}[{{range}}])%20*%20100&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}

### MongoDB connections (liên quan CPU/thread contention)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_ss_connections{state="current"}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 5/6] NETWORK IN
### Đo: Bytes nhận vào MongoDB từ clients/apps
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Bytes nhận vào MongoDB (qua MongoDB exporter)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesIn[{{range}}])

### MB/s nhận vào
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesIn[{{range}}])%20/%201024%20/%201024

### Network IN qua cAdvisor
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}[{{range}}])

### Network IN range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesIn[{{range}}])&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MONGO 6/6] NETWORK OUT
### Đo: Bytes MongoDB gửi ra cho clients/apps
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Bytes gửi ra từ MongoDB
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesOut[{{range}}])

### MB/s gửi ra
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesOut[{{range}}])%20/%201024%20/%201024

### Network OUT qua cAdvisor
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="mongodb"}[{{range}}])

### Network OUT range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(mongodb_ss_network_bytesOut[{{range}}])&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}



# ==============================================================
# SECTION 3: MINIO METRICS
# ==============================================================

### [MINIO] Health Check
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=up{job="minio"}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 1/6] STORAGE USAGE
### Đo: Dung lượng lưu trữ thực tế đang dùng
### Đơn vị: bytes
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Tổng dung lượng đang dùng (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes

### Dung lượng đã sử dụng (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes

### % storage đã dùng
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(1%20-%20(minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes%20/%20minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes))%20*%20100

### Dung lượng theo bucket
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_bucket_usage_total_bytes

### Objects count theo bucket
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_bucket_objects_count

### Storage usage range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes%20-%20minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes&start=now-24h&end=now&step=5m


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 2/6] REQUEST/SEC (Throughput)
### Đo: Số HTTP requests MinIO xử lý mỗi giây
### Đơn vị: requests/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Tổng requests/sec (tất cả loại)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(minio_s3_requests_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(api)

### Requests/sec theo API type (GET, PUT, DELETE, LIST...)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total{api="GetObject"}[{{range}}])

### PUT requests/sec (uploads)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total{api="PutObject"}[{{range}}])

### Error rate (4xx + 5xx)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(minio_s3_requests_errors_total[{{range}}]))%20by%20(api)

### Requests/sec range
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=sum(rate(minio_s3_requests_total[{{range}}]))&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 3/6] CPU
### Đo: CPU usage của MinIO container
### Đơn vị: cores (0.0 = 0%, 1.0 = 100% of 1 core)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### CPU cores sử dụng (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}[{{range}}])

### CPU % (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}[{{range}}])%20*%20100

### CPU range
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}[{{range}}])%20*%20100&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 4/6] RAM (MEMORY)
### Đo: Bộ nhớ MinIO đang dùng (Go runtime + OS cache)
### Đơn vị: bytes
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### RAM đang dùng (MinIO native metric)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_node_process_resident_memory_bytes

### RAM working set (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=container_memory_working_set_bytes{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}

### RAM RSS (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=container_memory_rss{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}

### RAM range query
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=container_memory_working_set_bytes{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 5/6] NETWORK IN
### Đo: Bytes upload vào MinIO (PUT/POST requests)
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### S3 traffic IN (bytes nhận) - MinIO native
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_received_bytes[{{range}}])

### Network IN container (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_receive_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}[{{range}}])

### MB/s nhận vào
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_received_bytes[{{range}}])%20/%201024%20/%201024

### Network IN range
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_received_bytes[{{range}}])&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### [MINIO 6/6] NETWORK OUT
### Đo: Bytes download từ MinIO (GET requests)
### Đơn vị: bytes/second
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### S3 traffic OUT (bytes gửi đi) - MinIO native
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_sent_bytes[{{range}}])

### Network OUT container (cAdvisor)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(container_network_transmit_bytes_total{container_label_com_docker_compose_service="minio"}[{{range}}])

### MB/s gửi đi
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_sent_bytes[{{range}}])%20/%201024%20/%201024

### Network OUT range
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(minio_s3_traffic_sent_bytes[{{range}}])&start=now-1h&end=now&step={{step}}



# ==============================================================
# SECTION 4: API SUMMARY AGGREGATED QUERIES
# (Dùng cho /api/summary endpoint trong Go service)
# ==============================================================

### Snapshot tất cả metrics - 1 call lấy overview
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query={__name__=~"kafka_consumergroup_lag|minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes|mongodb_ss_connections"}

### Kafka summary: lag + network
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(kafka_consumergroup_lag)

### MongoDB summary: ops + latency + connections
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[5m]))

### MinIO summary: storage % + requests
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(1%20-%20(minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes%20/%20minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes))%20*%20100
